+/**
+ * PHP's `S`: the English ordinal suffix of the day of the month ("st", "nd", "rd", "th"),
+ * as the server prints it in English. Other languages get none, as before.
+ * @param {DateTime} dateTime - The Luxon DateTime object, with its locale set.
+ * @returns {string} The suffix, or an empty string outside English or for an invalid date.
